AUTO-NAVIGATE AFTER SIGNUP - HouseHLD (app/(auth)/signup.tsx)

REQUIRED FLOW:
1. User submits signup form successfully
2. Show animated success modal with congratulations
3. Display 3-second countdown
4. Auto-redirect to Sign In page
5. Allow user to skip countdown

IMPLEMENTATION:

=== SUCCESS MODAL DESIGN ===

OVERLAY: Full screen, rgba(0,0,0,0.5) background

CARD (centered):
- Width: 90%, max 400px
- Border radius: 16px, padding: 32px
- White background, shadow
- Content (top to bottom):
  * Green checkmark circle: 64x64, #10B981
  * Heading: "Account Created!" (24px bold, #1F2937)
  * Message: "Welcome to HouseHLD! Redirecting you to sign in..." (16px, #6B7280)
  * Countdown: "Redirecting in {countdown}..." (14px, #6366F1)
  * Skip link: "Sign In Now" (16px, #6366F1, underlined)

ANIMATIONS:
- Overlay fade in: 200ms
- Card scale: 0.9 to 1.0, 300ms spring
- Countdown: Update every 1 second

=== CODE STRUCTURE ===

```tsx
const [showSuccess, setShowSuccess] = useState(false);
const [countdown, setCountdown] = useState(3);

const handleSignUp = async () => {
  const { error } = await signUp(email, password, name, role);
  if (error) {
    Alert.alert('Error', error);
    return;
  }

  setShowSuccess(true);

  // Start countdown
  let counter = 3;
  const timer = setInterval(() => {
    counter--;
    setCountdown(counter);
    if (counter === 0) {
      clearInterval(timer);
      navigation.navigate('login');
    }
  }, 1000);
};

const handleSkip = () => {
  setShowSuccess(false);
  navigation.navigate('login');
};

// In render:
{showSuccess && (
  <View style={styles.overlay}>
    <View style={styles.card}>
      <View style={styles.checkmark}>✓</View>
      <Text style={styles.title}>Account Created!</Text>
      <Text style={styles.message}>Welcome to HouseHLD! Redirecting you to sign in...</Text>
      <Text style={styles.countdown}>Redirecting in {countdown}...</Text>
      <TouchableOpacity onPress={handleSkip}>
        <Text style={styles.skip}>Sign In Now</Text>
      </TouchableOpacity>
    </View>
  </View>
)}
```

=== KEY STYLES ===

overlay: position absolute, full screen, bg rgba(0,0,0,0.5), center content, zIndex 1000
card: width 90% max 400, borderRadius 16, padding 32, bg white, alignItems center, shadow
checkmark: 64x64 circle, bg #10B981, center white checkmark icon
title: 24px bold #1F2937, marginBottom 12
message: 16px #6B7280, center, marginBottom 16
countdown: 14px #6366F1, fontWeight 600, marginBottom 16
skip: 16px #6366F1, fontWeight 600, underline

=== CLEANUP ===

```tsx
useEffect(() => {
  let interval;
  if (showSuccess) {
    interval = startCountdown();
  }
  return () => {
    if (interval) clearInterval(interval);
  };
}, [showSuccess]);
```

=== SUCCESS CRITERIA ===

✓ Modal appears after successful signup
✓ Countdown 3→2→1 with 1-second intervals
✓ Auto-redirect at 0
✓ Skip button works immediately
✓ Interval cleanup on unmount
✓ Smooth animations
✓ Works on all screen sizes

=== OPTIONAL ENHANCEMENTS ===

- Pass email to login: navigation.navigate('login', {email})
- Haptic feedback: Haptics.notificationAsync('success')
- Confetti animation for celebration

